script = ExtResource("1_a2d0s")
dialogue_id = "debate_extinction"
record_title = "Debate Speech: The Possiblity of Extinction"
text = "PAGE: historian(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
historian: I have some somber news to report.
historian: As far as we can tell, the shard that held our very first shrine is no longer inhabited.
historian: I consulted the archives to understand what happened.
historian: It seems the tragedy is rooted in the same day that the shrine was consecrated.
historian: That day, a wild animal damaged the shrine's fence.
historian: In their zeal to protect the holy ground, the priests declared the local wildlife to be evil spirits.
historian: Over the centuries, bit by bit, they damaged the natural balance so much that the land could no longer support them.
historian: They had ten thousand chances to mend their ways, yet they clung to their mistaken beliefs.
historian: But can we truly blame them?
historian: They had been told that it is the unquestionable will of the Enlightened One.
historian: If we follow a rigid, universal faith without question, we will have no chance to correct our course.
historian: We must remain free to trust our own common sense, and to make our own choices."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
